# Bill — shared ignore rules.
# The stack the README defines: Python as the core, delivered as a single binary,
# with the WebApp in TypeScript/Vue/Vite. Two groups are specific to this repo:
# the local agent harness (development only) and the runtime state a Working
# Folder creates.

# --- Local agent harness (development only, not part of this repository) -----
/.claude
/hooks

# --- Working Folder runtime state (created by the binary where it runs) ------
# The folders a person reads follow the person's language (§3), so the checkout
# creates them under whichever spelling is active. Both are ignored, always:
# which one exists depends on nothing a repository should carry.
/App
/app
/Tables
/Tabelas
/Files
/Arquivos
/Projects
/Projetos
/Shared
/Compartilhada

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.eggs/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- TypeScript / Vue / Vite -------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.vite/
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Build output (core binary and WebApp bundle) ----------------------------
build/
dist/
dist-ssr/

# --- Environment files -------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Editors and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Data ----------------------------------------------------------
/data
/prose
/.bill